{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/113906","id":3093777229,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc64Z0tN","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113906","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113906.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113906.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113906","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/113906/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/113906/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113906/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/f31fd998dca2f0e2aedc579be41747d532dd06f6","number":113906,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Add `physics_space_override` to `TileMapLayer` for functionally-3D games","user":{"login":"Kapparoti","id":145791332,"node_id":"U_kgDOCLCZZA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/145791332?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kapparoti","html_url":"https://github.com/Kapparoti","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kapparoti/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kapparoti/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kapparoti/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kapparoti/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kapparoti/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kapparoti/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kapparoti/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kapparoti/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kapparoti/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"**Associated proposal:** [13837](https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/13837)\r\n\r\n**Reason of this pr:**\r\nEasily create isolated Z-levels in 2D games, [to leave collision layers for game-mechanics rather than level design.](https://www.reddit.com/r/godot/comments/1fkhvwy/is_there_any_way_to_access_the_collisionbodies_of/)\r\n\r\n**Implementation:**\r\nAdded TileMapLayer physics_space_override RID member variable and its setter/getter functions, in the same way as already-present navigation_map_override.\r\nWhen not set, as navigation_map_override, the TileMapLayer will fall back to use its world2D.space\r\n\r\n**Usage scenarios:**\r\nCan be used in any game requiring isolated physics contexts for different visual layers, such as multi-floor buildings or Dwarf Fortress-style games.\r\n\r\n```GDScript\r\nvar floor1_space: RID = PhysicsServer2D.space_create()\r\nvar floor2_space: RID = PhysicsServer2D.space_create()\r\n\r\n$Floor1TileMapLayer.set_physics_space(floor1_space)\r\n$Floor2TileMapLayer.set_physics_space(floor2_space)\r\n``` \r\n\r\n* *Bugsquad edit, closes: https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/13837*","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":370471880,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzNzA0NzE4ODA=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:physics","name":"topic:physics","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708059,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4MDU5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:2d","name":"topic:2d","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/